  "description": "From [Tapas](https://www.mangaupdates.com/groups.html?id=4290065293):  \n\nKkotbun lives a miserable life as a slave in Joseon. As punishment for merely wanting an education, she is sent up a mountain to catch a rabbit in the dead of winter. When she comes across a ferocious tiger, she thinks she’s met her end, but to her surprise, she wakes up in a world filled with colorful magic. \n\nRenaming herself Rose, she’s now a potential pupil of the greatest light mage in the land. But with her affinity with dark magic, can she thrive rather than just survive in this new world?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%A3%BC%EB%AC%B8%EC%9D%84-%EB%A7%90%ED%95%B4-%EB%A1%9C%EC%A6%88/2749), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/58851301)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English](https://tapas.io/series/say-the-spell-rose/info), [S.Chinese](https://pdt.tencentac.com/?adtag=appshare.ios.detail%26QQ%26273&contentId=273), [T.Chinese](https://tw.kakaowebtoon.com/content/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3%E8%98%BF%E7%B5%B2/761), [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/112386)",
